  "details": "As it currently stands, we're able to change the order of our joined groups via the 'Groups' tab. That's great! But the problem comes when this personalized order isn't synced with the group view of profiles.\n\nIt's frustrating when you take the time to organize groups in one menu, only to discover that it was a waste because other players will go to your profile to see a jumbled mess.\n\nI really hope this will be changed in the future. \n\nApologies if development regarding this issue has already been taken into consideration.",
